<div class="about-wrapper">
  <div class="linux-corner-deco">
    <div class="linux-dot linux-dot-red"></div>
    <div class="linux-dot linux-dot-yellow"></div>
    <div class="linux-dot linux-dot-green"></div>
    <span class="linux-label">~/about</span>
  </div>

  <div class="about-page">
    <!-- 背景装饰 -->
    <div class="about-bg-deco about-bg-deco-1"></div>
    <div class="about-bg-deco about-bg-deco-2"></div>

    <div class="about-hero">
      <div class="about-hero-glow"></div>
      <div class="about-avatar-frame">
        <img class="about-avatar-img" src="<%= url_for(theme.defaults.avatar) %>" alt="avatar">
      </div>
      <h1 class="about-hero-name">dddemo</h1>
      <p class="about-hero-bio">一个脱离了高级趣味的人</p>
      <div class="about-hero-line"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quote -->
    <div class="about-quote-card">
      <div class="about-quote-mark">"</div>
      <p class="about-quote-text">Less is more.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 内容区 -->
    <div class="about-body">
      <div class="about-card">
        <div class="about-card-header">📝 关于我</div>
        <p class="about-card-text">
          我是dddemo，上不知天文，下不知地理。
        </p>
        <p class="about-card-text">
          一个爱好coding但被混沌魔王困在生活的普通人<br>
          这里什么都有，也什么都没有，乱七八糟<br>
          不用等我更新，听天由命，不知道什么时候我就会偷偷改点东西<br>
          欢迎联系我，可以给我发邮件
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-card">
        <div class="about-card-header">🔗 联系方式</div>
        <div class="about-links">
          <div class="contact-list">
            <a class="contact-item" href="mailto:Sophisticated_table@outlook.com" title="发邮件">
              <span class="contact-item-icon"><i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i></span>
              <span class="contact-item-label">Outlook</span>
              <span class="contact-item-addr">Sophisticated_table@outlook.com</span>
            </a>
            <a class="contact-item" href="https://github.com/dddemo-c" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="GitHub">
              <span class="contact-item-icon"><i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i></span>
              <span class="contact-item-label">GitHub</span>
              <span class="contact-item-addr">github.com/dddemo-c</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <% /* 你可以继续在这里加卡片 */ %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
